      "text": "the Lord will do work among men which will be everlasting, 1 Ne. 14:7. Lamanites were encircled with everlasting darkness, but God has brought them into everlasting light, Alma 26:15. teach this people everlasting hatred against sin and iniquity, Alma 37:32. ye have procrastinated day of salvation until everlastingly too late, Hel. 13:38. everlasting decree of God that those who inhabit land must serve him or be swept off, Ether 2:10. charity is everlasting love, Moro. 8:17.",
